223	Let $\can$ be the canonical form from \ref{lemma:canonical-form} composed with the isomorphism $\G_2 \cong \mathcal{P}_2^{\otimes 2}$.
224	\begin{lemma}\label{lemma:G2-m0-equals-1}
225		For each generator $e\in E$, the equation $\can(e)e\1 = 1$ has a group picture in which each generator and relation appear at most $3$ times. 
